      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-22T17:30:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t think Mr Fixer’s crowbar damage would be irreducible, given that’s already a keyword. It would be… un-subtractable?<br>\nWithout going overly verbose I think ‘same amount of damage’ is the closest you’re going to get to your sentiments…</p>",
