      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-14T03:15:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I've played Dual Crowbars I play it as though it reads: \"Mr.Fixer may attack two targets instead of one.\" Any of his cards or powers that say \"1 target\" are treated as though they say \"2 targets.\"</p>",
