      "raw": "<p>When I&#39;ve played Dual Crowbars I play it as though it reads: &quot;Mr.Fixer may attack two targets instead of one.&quot; Any of his cards or powers that say &quot;1 target&quot; are treated as though they say &quot;2 targets.&quot;</p>",
